        text="This report delivers a Navigational Assessment and a Navigation Risk Assessment carried out by Marine &amp; Risk Consultants Limited (MARICO Marine) for Sea Generation (Wales) Ltd (SeaGen Wales) covering the\r\nconstruction, operation and decommissioning of the proposed Skerries Tidal Stream Array project, located between the coast of Anglesey and the offshore Skerries rocks; an area well known for strong tidal currents.",
