        text="This report details the findings of a survey of the sunset cup coral Leptopsammia pruvoti population at Lundy. Fieldwork was carried out by a 5-man dive team over three days from 4th to 6th September 2007. The dataset contains counts of sunset cups corals around Lundy taken by divers and analysis of underwater photographs. The data in the report contains digital photographs, species lists and abundance as well as accurate site locations where the samples were collected.",
