        text="Bibby HydroMap were commissioned in May 2018 by Orsted to carry out Geophysical and Benthic surveys at Horsea 03 Lots 5 and 8. \r\n The survey across the Lot 8 export route was completed under Bibby HydroMap's terms and conditions using MV Bibby Tethra, between 16th August and 3rd September 2018 with a 40m line spacing. \r\n The main objectives of the surveys were as follows: \r\n Ã¢?Â¢ Cable route engineering \r\n Ã¢?Â¢ Geo-hazard assessment \r\n Ã¢?Â¢ Consenting requirements \r\n o Identifying archaeological restrictions \r\n o Identifying protected ecological habitats \r\n Ã¢?Â¢ Planning of Geotechnical investigations \r\n Ã¢?Â¢ UXO clearance for Geotechnical investigations \r\n This dataset comprises of the SSS data across the survey area.",
