        text="The surveys were carried out as part of the environmental monitoring programme outlined within FEPA licences 31792/10/1 and 31814/10/2 for the Lynn and Inner Dowsing (LID) wind farms respectively. This series details the findings of the first and second year of post-construction surveys, and makes comparisons with the data collected during pre-construction surveys. The second year post-construction surveys (potting, shrimp trawl, otter and beam trawl and longlining) generally replicated that of the first year post-construction and pre-construction surveys (August 2004 to July 2005) and utilised local fishermen and fishing vessels.",
