        text="This report assesses the habitat and biotopes of various study sites around the Thanet coast. Biotopes were assessed by walking the entire length of the coast, traversing the foreshore reef in a 'zig-zag' manner to cover biotopes at all shore levels. The dataset includes species lists, GIS mapping and detailed biotope descriptions at the point of study.",
