        text="Operations and maintenance geophysical survey for Teesside Offshore Wind Farm between 26 March 2014 and 5 April 2014. \r\nThe aims of the survey were to: To identify debris within the construction area; To identify changes to seabed morphology, to enable the evaluation of the\r\neffectiveness of installed scour protection and ratify the predictions for scour\r\ndevelopment; To Inform the foundation and cable maintenance schedule; To satisfy the requirements of the Marine License, specifically the monitoring of\r\nArchaeological Exclusion Zones.",
